messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: example/tree1.c
Line: 72
Function: main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: If xmlReadFile fails, doc is NULL (lines 65-69). The code still calls xmlDocGetRootElement(doc) at line 72, which will dereference the NULL pointer inside libxml2, causing a crash.

Source context:
```c
