       80: }
```

The reproducer will be compiled with:
  clang -fsanitize=address -g -O0 -I/tmp/libxml2_upstream reproducer.c -L/tmp/libxml2_upstream/build/.libs -ltiff -lm

The project source root is: /tmp/libxml2_upstream
